<title>AUSTRALIA: Angus &amp; Coote half year profit rises.</title>
<headline>Angus &amp; Coote half year profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-04-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to January 31</p>
<p>		     (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		 6.75 vs  3.01</p>
<p>    Net				  2.97 vs  1.89</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		 nil  vs 4.0</p>
<p>Note: Angus &amp; Coote (Holdings) Ltd is a jewellery retailer.  </p>
<p>    Sales			 131.38 vs  83.30</p>
<p>    Other income		  0.14 vs   0.25</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)		  31.6  vs 20.1</p>
<p>    Abnormal items	 loss 2.91 vs nil</p>
<p>    Tax			     0.86 vs  1.12</p>
<p>    Interest			1.66 vs  0.805</p>
<p>    Depreciation		  2.87 vs  1.97</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
